  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "研究背景",
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "大规模预训练后，全量微调因需重训所有参数而变得不太可行，例如部署多个GPT-3 175B微调实例成本过高。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "ev_4453cede80f66bed4105"
          ],
          "status": "source_checked",
          "kind": "paper_fact",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "evidence_id": "ev_4453cede80f66bed4105",
              "quote": "As\nwe pre-train larger models, full ﬁne-tuning, which retrains all model parameters,\nbecomes less feasible. Using GPT-3 175B as an example – deploying indepen-\ndent instances of ﬁne-tuned models, each with 175B parameters, is prohibitively\nexpensive.",
              "model_quote": "As we pre-train larger models, full fine-tuning, which retrains all model parameters, becomes less feasible. Using GPT-3 175B as an example – deploying independent instances of fine-tuned models, each with 175B parameters, is prohibitively expensive.",
              "match": "normalized_pdf_text",
              "start": 161,
              "end": 411
            }
          ],
          "semantic_verified": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "方法与路线",
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "Pre-LN Transformer将层归一化置于残差块内部，理论表明其初始化时梯度行为良好，因此可移除预热阶段。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "ev_6d1d6b38673ef4cbc0ba"
          ],
          "status": "source_checked",
          "kind": "paper_fact",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "evidence_id": "ev_6d1d6b38673ef4cbc0ba",
              "quote": "if the layer\nnormalization is put inside the residual blocks\n(recently proposed as Pre-LN Transformer), the\ngradients are well-behaved at initialization. This\nmotivates us to remove the warm-up stage for the\ntraining of Pre-LN Transformers.",
              "model_quote": "if the layer normalization is put inside the residual blocks (recently proposed as Pre-LN Transformer), the gradients are well-behaved at initialization. This motivates us to remove the warm-up stage for the training of Pre-LN Transformers.",
              "match": "normalized_pdf_text",
              "start": 918,
              "end": 1158
            }
          ],
          "semantic_verified": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "跨文综合",
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "与GPT-3 175B用Adam全量微调相比，LoRA可将可训练参数减少10,000倍，GPU内存需求减少3倍。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "ev_4453cede80f66bed4105"
          ],
          "status": "source_checked",
          "kind": "paper_fact",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "evidence_id": "ev_4453cede80f66bed4105",
              "quote": "Compared to GPT-3 175B ﬁne-tuned with Adam,\nLoRA can reduce the number of trainable parameters by 10,000 times and the\nGPU memory requirement by 3 times.",
              "model_quote": "Compared to GPT-3 175B fine-tuned with Adam, LoRA can reduce the number of trainable parameters by 10,000 times and the GPU memory requirement by 3 times.",
              "match": "normalized_pdf_text",
              "start": 673,
              "end": 826
            }
          ],
          "semantic_verified": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "局限与边界",
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "Post-LN Transformer在初始化时输出层附近参数的期望梯度较大，使用大学习率会导致训练不稳定，预热阶段有助于避免此问题。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "ev_6d1d6b38673ef4cbc0ba"
          ],
          "status": "source_checked",
          "kind": "paper_fact",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "evidence_id": "ev_6d1d6b38673ef4cbc0ba",
              "quote": "for the\noriginal-designed Post-LN Transformer, which\nplaces the layer normalization between the resid-\nual blocks, the expected gradients of the parame-\nters near the output layer are large. Therefore, us-\ning a large learning rate on those gradients makes\nthe training unstable.",
              "model_quote": "for the original-designed Post-LN Transformer, which places the layer normalization between the residual blocks, the expected gradients of the parameters near the output layer are large. Therefore, using a large learning rate on those gradients makes the training unstable.",
              "match": "normalized_pdf_text",
              "start": 522,
              "end": 801
            }
          ],
          "semantic_verified": false
        },
        {
          "text": "LoRA的有效性通过语言模型适配中秩亏缺的实证研究得到阐释，但该研究未声称适用于所有模型或任务。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "ev_4453cede80f66bed4105"
          ],
          "status": "source_checked",
          "kind": "paper_fact",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "evidence_id": "ev_4453cede80f66bed4105",
              "quote": "We also provide an empirical investigation into\nrank-deﬁciency in language model adaptation, which sheds light on the efﬁcacy of\nLoRA.",
              "model_quote": "We also provide an empirical investigation into rank-deficiency in language model adaptation, which sheds light on the efficacy of LoRA.",
              "match": "normalized_pdf_text",
              "start": 1061,
              "end": 1195
            }
          ],
          "semantic_verified": false
        }
      ]
    }
